          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Industrial biotechnology careers use microbes and enzymes to make chemicals, fuels, materials and ingredients at scale, and they depend on fermentation skill, process control, scale-up thinking and careful quality and safety practice."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Learn bioprocess basics, spend time in a fermentation lab or plant and document one small optimisation exercise."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Verify the track record of any employer or training provider and avoid guaranteed-job offers."
          }
        ]
      },
